      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "AWS spans 33 Regions, 105 Availability Zones (AZs)\n\nRegion (us-east-1)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 AZ: us-east-1a  \u2500\u2500\u2500 Data Center(s)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 AZ: us-east-1b  \u2500\u2500\u2500 Data Center(s)\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 AZ: us-east-1c  \u2500\u2500\u2500 Data Center(s)\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 ...\n\nKey concepts:\n- Region: geographic area (choose based on latency, compliance, cost)\n- AZ: isolated data center(s) within a region\n- Edge Location: CloudFront CDN cache (600+ worldwide)"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "# Install AWS CLI v2\n# macOS\nbrew install awscli\n\n# Verify\naws --version\n\n# Configure credentials\naws configure\n# AWS Access Key ID: AKIA...\n# AWS Secret Access Key: ****\n# Default region: us-east-1\n# Default output: json\n\n# Or use SSO (recommended for organizations)\naws configure sso\naws sso login --profile myprofile"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "bash",
          "# Who am I?\naws sts get-caller-identity\n\n# List S3 buckets\naws s3 ls\n\n# List EC2 instances\naws ec2 describe-instances --query \"Reservations[].Instances[].{ID:InstanceId,State:State.Name,Type:InstanceType}\" --output table\n\n# List regions\naws ec2 describe-regions --query \"Regions[].RegionName\" --output text"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        [
          "python",
          "import boto3\n\n# Create a session\nsession = boto3.Session(region_name='us-east-1')\n\n# List all S3 buckets\ns3 = session.client('s3')\nresponse = s3.list_buckets()\nfor bucket in response['Buckets']:\n    print(f\"  {bucket['Name']} (created {bucket['CreationDate'].strftime('%Y-%m-%d')})\")\n\n# Get account ID\nsts = session.client('sts')\nidentity = sts.get_caller_identity()\nprint(f\"Account: {identity['Account']}\")\nprint(f\"ARN: {identity['Arn']}\")"
        ]
      ]
    },
